ic army from being unleashed onto their creators!\n\nShift-Shock is a casual shooter combining Sci Fi guns with Sci Fi mele weapons.  \n\n-Single player\n-13 missions \n- Has a few experimental vehicle missions\n-more missions coming in future updates including more vehicle missions\n\nThis casual shooter has a large range of weapons and some large levels with large play zones.\n", "short_description": "Casual VR first person shooter."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://darkmattermediallc.wixsite.com/shift-shock-day-one/blank-3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dark Matter Media LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://darkmattermediallc.wixsite.com/shift-shock-day-one", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1158787088080960"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974869_2530831174431065_2160829728591177073_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oKp-h6vMoO4Q7kNvwGALhd8&_nc_oc=AdlTi04dpdYYojCsADeeqCN5FaYJwF-R65REFTXNUYTJcVcxsWJvQ-U2CAsjlhjlemU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftqs0lKYoSh9bxuJeZPQtJapKVOq-4GfeWzSWXq9Y7j3A&oe=69A2E758"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Shift-shock: Day One"